message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Explainable Heart Disease Risk Prediction (SHAP-based)"
abstract: >-
  An explainable machine-learning demo that predicts heart disease risk from
  clinical indicators and returns per-patient SHAP attributions in
  clinician-facing language. The goal is interpretability, not accuracy.
type: software
authors:
